SUMMARY:Bam-A-Lam
DESCRIPTION:\nThis duo of guitar/drums one-man-band multi-dextrous rock-n-r
 oll fire and standup bass acrobatics with harmony singing appears to have 
 several more arms and heads (than 4 and 2 respectively) and serve up lo-fi
  pop aural satisfaction.\n\n\n\nMade up of Asheville musical veterans Jaso
 n Krekel and Craig Kellberg who combined have performed under more bands a
 nd diverse genre styles than can be counted…Has to be seen to be believe
 d!\n\n\n\nMusic 8:30-11:30pm\, $10 at the door.\n\n\n\n\nhttps://youtu.be/
