URL:https://jackofthewood.com/events/ghost-ship-halloween-featuring-nelson
 s-blood/
SUMMARY:Ghost Ship Halloween Featuring Nelson's Blood
DESCRIPTION:\nAhoy me mateys and happy Halloween from all of us here at Jac
 k of the Wood! Come join us for our ghost ship themed Halloween party! Don
  your patches and parrots\, your bracers and bangles\, and your boots and 
 booty for this one of a kind celebration that you can only find right here
  at Jack's! Ghoukish grogs &amp\; pirate punches a'plenty\, late-night foo
 d\, and a costume contest — pirate garb encouraged!Entertainment will be
  provided all night by Asheville's premier pirate band\, Nelson's Blood! T
 hat's right folks\, we have a legit pirate band. Be there\, lest ye be squ
 are.Music 8:30-11:30pm $10 cover at the door.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\
 n\n\n
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://jackofthewood.com/wp-content/uploads/202
 6/09/10-31-26_NelsonsBlood-HALLOWEEN_IG_1080x1440.jpg
END:VEVENT
