X-SOURCE:Jack of the Wood
UID:12003@jackofthewood.com
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261113T203000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261113T233000
DTSTAMP:20260428T212530Z
URL:https://jackofthewood.com/events/the-plate-scrapers/
SUMMARY:The Plate Scrapers
DESCRIPTION:\n\n\n\n\n"They make a classic bluegrass sound that's not afrai
 d to go somewhere new." —Appalachian Jamwich\n\n\n\nBorn from the tradit
 ion of bluegrass jams &amp\; potlucks\, THE PLATE SCRAPERS — Derek Kretz
 er (banjo)\, Andrew Jordan (guitar)\, Robbie Mann (fiddle)\, Jody Mosser (
 dobro)\, and Kevin Johnson (bass) — have been putting in the work and sh
 owcasing their love for the genre since 2014. They’ve since released 3 s
 tudio albums\, 3 live albums\, and have toured relentlessly up and down th
 e east coast and into the midwest. \n\n\n\nIn 2019\, they won the Podunk B
 luegrass Telefunken Band Contest. They have been featured on WAMU Bluegras
 s Country Radio\, performed as an IBMA Official Showcase artist\, and thei
 r latest release\, "Destination Horizon" (2020) debuted at #9 on the Blueg
 rass Album Billboard charts with rave reviews from Bluegrass Today.&nbsp\;
 \n\n\n\nAs a progressively-minded bluegrass band that strives to maintain 
 a healthy equilibrium between their diverse musical backgrounds and tradit
 ional Appalachian sounds\, they’ve wowed audiences across the entire spe
 ctrum\, truly feeling at home on any stage. \n\n\n\nThey’ve provided dir
 ect support for bluegrass legends such as The Seldom Scene\, Frank Solivan
  &amp\; Dirty Kitchen\, and Larry Keel. On the other side of that coin\, t
 hey aren’t afraid to get weird at a late night festival slot and have be
 come well known for their tastefully balanced and refreshingly diverse son
 gwriting. \n\n\n\nCatch their live show and you’ll be sure to receive a 
 full helping of hard-driving bluegrass favorites and heart-wrenching count
 ry ballads!Music 8:30-11:30pm $10 cover at the door.\n\n\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n\n\
 n\nhttps://youtu.be/Xlml_31j6AI\n\n\n\n\n\nhttps://youtu.be/uvjI7wZRge0\n\
 n\n\n
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://jackofthewood.com/wp-content/uploads/202
 3/03/16716259_674227479405273_8416512359409906653_o.jpg
END:VEVENT
